{"version":1,"content":"<p>Fedora項目最新舉行的Go/No-Go發佈評審會議決定，Fedora 45再次未能獲得發佈許可。這意味着該版本不僅未能按照原定的提前發佈時間表在本周推出，也將錯過下周的發佈窗口，發佈時間至少再推遲一周。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583446.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:59.896060+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:19:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_hash":"7c5d0fe180d3d1a76313ef1b41c4f078472b6fc3d88e2c393102fecf50f17005","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}